{"seq":3,"slug":"inference-runtime-pipeline","title":"推理运行时与执行流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/foundations/inference-runtime-pipeline","wordCount":1315,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"推理运行时与执行流水线\">推理运行时与执行流水线</h1><p>当你调用 <code>model.predict(input)</code> 时，一行代码背后是一条复杂的执行流水线：模型文件被反序列化为内存中的计算图，图优化器执行常量折叠与算子融合，调度器将算子分配到最适合的硬件后端，最终张量数据在 CPU/GPU/NPU 之间的共享内存中流转完成一次端到端推理。理解这条流水线是诊断延迟瓶颈和优化模型性能的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>推理运行时的职责可以分为四个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[模型文件&lt;br/&gt;.mlpackage/.tflite/.onnx] --&gt; B[图加载&lt;br/&gt;反序列化]&#10;    B --&gt; C[图优化&lt;br/&gt;融合/折叠/布局变换]&#10;    C --&gt; D[硬件调度&lt;br/&gt;算子→NPU/GPU/CPU]&#10;    D --&gt; E[执行引擎&lt;br/&gt;内核调用/内存管理]&#10;    E --&gt; F[输出张量]\">flowchart LR\n    A[模型文件&lt;br/&gt;.mlpackage/.tflite/.onnx] --&gt; B[图加载&lt;br/&gt;反序列化]\n    B --&gt; C[图优化&lt;br/&gt;融合/折叠/布局变换]\n    C --&gt; D[硬件调度&lt;br/&gt;算子→NPU/GPU/CPU]\n    D --&gt; E[执行引擎&lt;br/&gt;内核调用/内存管理]\n    E --&gt; F[输出张量]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>关键操作</th>\n<th>耗时特征</th>\n<th>可优化方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图加载</td>\n<td>文件 I/O + 权重解压</td>\n<td>冷启动 1-3s</td>\n<td>模型缓存/预加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图优化</td>\n<td>常量折叠/算子融合/布局变换</td>\n<td>首次 50-200ms</td>\n<td>AOT 编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件调度</td>\n<td>逐算子设备选择</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n<td>提示/强制委托</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行</td>\n<td>矩阵运算/内存搬运</td>\n<td>推理主体 3-200ms</td>\n<td>量化/模型裁剪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"计算图优化\">计算图优化</h2><h3 id=\"算子融合-operator-fusion\">算子融合（Operator Fusion）</h3><p>将多个连续算子合并为一个复合内核，减少内存读写次数和调度开销：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Conv+BN+ReLU → 单一融合算子</strong>：消除 BatchNorm 的逐元素乘加和 ReLU 的条件分支</li>\n<li><strong>MatMul+Add+GELU → 融合 FFN 块</strong>：Transformer 前馈网络的典型融合模式</li>\n<li><strong>QKV Projection + Multi-Head Split → 融合 Attention 前半段</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"常量折叠-constant-folding\">常量折叠（Constant Folding）</h3><p>在编译期计算所有仅依赖常量输入的子图，消除运行时冗余计算。典型例子：将 BatchNorm 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma, \\beta, \\mu, \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 折叠进前一层的卷积权重中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"布局变换-layout-transformation\">布局变换（Layout Transformation）</h3><p>不同硬件后端偏好不同的张量内存布局：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPU：NCHW（批量×通道×高×宽）</li>\n<li>GPU/Metal：NHWC 或 tile 格式</li>\n<li>Apple ANE：特定的 16 对齐通道布局</li>\n</ul>\n<p>图优化器在编译期插入必要的布局转换算子，或将模型权重预转换为目标布局以避免运行时开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬件委托机制\">硬件委托机制</h2><h3 id=\"core-ml-的自动调度\">Core ML 的自动调度</h3><p>Core ML 通过 <code>MLModelConfiguration.computeUnits</code> 控制调度策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let config = MLModelConfiguration()&#10;config.computeUnits = .all  // ANE + GPU + CPU 自动选择\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MLModelConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config.computeUnits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .all  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ANE + GPU + CPU 自动选择</span></span></code></pre></div><p>调度器对每个算子独立判断最优执行设备。在 Apple Silicon 的统一内存架构下，设备切换的代价仅是一次调度决策，而非数据拷贝——同一块物理内存同时被 ANE、GPU、CPU 访问。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tensorflow-lite-的-delegate-架构\">TensorFlow Lite 的 Delegate 架构</h3><p>TFLite 通过可插拔的 Delegate 接口实现硬件加速：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NNAPI Delegate</strong>：Android 标准 AI 加速接口，路由到厂商 NPU</li>\n<li><strong>GPU Delegate</strong>：OpenGL ES / OpenCL / Vulkan 后端</li>\n<li><strong>Hexagon Delegate</strong>：直接调用 Qualcomm Hexagon DSP</li>\n<li><strong>Core ML Delegate</strong>：在 iOS 上将 TFLite 模型路由到 ANE</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"onnx-runtime-的-execution-provider\">ONNX Runtime 的 Execution Provider</h3><p>ONNX Runtime 使用 Execution Provider（EP）抽象硬件后端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"ONNX Model → Graph Partitioner → [CoreML EP | NNAPI EP | CPU EP]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ONNX Model → Graph Partitioner → [CoreML EP | NNAPI EP | CPU EP]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个 EP 可以&quot;认领&quot;它支持的算子子图，不支持的算子回退到 CPU EP 执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存管理与张量生命周期\">内存管理与张量生命周期</h2><p>移动设备内存有限（8-16GB，其中可用于 ML 的通常不超过 4-6GB），内存管理策略直接影响能否部署更大的模型：</p>\n<h3 id=\"内存映射-memory-mapped-weights\">内存映射（Memory-Mapped Weights）</h3><p>模型权重文件通过 <code>mmap()</code> 映射到虚拟地址空间，由操作系统按需加载物理页面。好处是冷启动时不需要一次性将全部权重读入 RAM；坏处是首次访问某层权重时可能触发 page fault。</p>\n<h3 id=\"张量共享与内存池\">张量共享与内存池</h3><p>推理过程中，中间张量的生命周期通常很短（前一层输出 = 后一层输入，用完即释放）。运行时通过<strong>内存池复用</strong>减少峰值内存占用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Peak Memory</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>schedule</mtext></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>live</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mtext>size</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Peak Memory} = \\max_{t \\in \\text{schedule}} \\sum_{tensor \\in \\text{live}(t)} \\text{size}(tensor)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak Memory</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">schedule</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7795em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sor</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">live</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">size</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sor</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>良好的调度顺序可以减少 30-50% 的峰值内存需求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"apple-统一内存-vs-android-分离内存\">Apple 统一内存 vs Android 分离内存</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Apple UMA</th>\n<th>Android (Qualcomm)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理内存</td>\n<td>CPU/GPU/NPU 共享</td>\n<td>CPU 与 GPU/NPU 各有映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重加载</td>\n<td>一次加载，三端可用</td>\n<td>需通过 ION/DMA-BUF 共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备切换开销</td>\n<td>仅调度决策</td>\n<td>可能有缓存刷新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对开发者影响</td>\n<td>几乎透明</td>\n<td>需关注 buffer 对齐与同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"冷启动与模型预热\">冷启动与模型预热</h2><p>第一次推理通常比后续推理慢 5-20 倍，原因包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>模型文件 I/O 与权重解压</li>\n<li>图优化/编译（JIT 或首次 AOT 缓存生成）</li>\n<li>硬件加速器初始化（NPU 固件加载）</li>\n<li>内存页面缺页中断</li>\n</ol>\n<p>生产实践中的缓解策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>后台预加载</strong>：App 启动时异步加载模型到内存</li>\n<li><strong>AOT 编译缓存</strong>：首次编译结果持久化，后续直接加载中间表示</li>\n<li><strong>模型分片加载</strong>：仅加载当前需要的层（用于超大 LLM）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>推理流水线包含四阶段：加载 → 优化 → 调度 → 执行</li>\n<li>算子融合是最有效的图优化手段，可减少 30-50% 的内存带宽需求</li>\n<li>硬件委托（Delegate/EP）是框架实现跨平台硬件加速的统一抽象</li>\n<li>内存管理策略决定了模型规模上限：mmap + 内存池复用是标配</li>\n<li>冷启动是端侧 ML 的用户体验短板，需通过预加载和 AOT 缓存缓解</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"model-compression-quantization\">模型压缩与量化技术</a> — 量化如何配合执行引擎的 INT4/INT8 内核实现加速</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../mobile-performance/startup-optimization/cold-start-analysis\">Android 启动优化：冷启动分析</a> — 模型加载对 App 冷启动时间的影响及优化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推理运行时与执行流水线","id":"推理运行时与执行流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"计算图优化","id":"计算图优化"},{"level":3,"text":"算子融合（Operator Fusion）","id":"算子融合-operator-fusion"},{"level":3,"text":"常量折叠（Constant Folding）","id":"常量折叠-constant-folding"},{"level":3,"text":"布局变换（Layout Transformation）","id":"布局变换-layout-transformation"},{"level":2,"text":"硬件委托机制","id":"硬件委托机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Core ML 的自动调度","id":"core-ml-的自动调度"},{"level":3,"text":"TensorFlow Lite 的 Delegate 架构","id":"tensorflow-lite-的-delegate-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"ONNX Runtime 的 Execution Provider","id":"onnx-runtime-的-execution-provider"},{"level":2,"text":"内存管理与张量生命周期","id":"内存管理与张量生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"内存映射（Memory-Mapped Weights）","id":"内存映射-memory-mapped-weights"},{"level":3,"text":"张量共享与内存池","id":"张量共享与内存池"},{"level":3,"text":"Apple 统一内存 vs Android 分离内存","id":"apple-统一内存-vs-android-分离内存"},{"level":2,"text":"冷启动与模型预热","id":"冷启动与模型预热"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"模型压缩与量化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/foundations/model-compression-quantization"},"next":{"title":"Core ML 与 Apple Intelligence","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/frameworks/core-ml-apple-intelligence"}}